<!doctype html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Ayrexx Tickets</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css"></head><body><main class="content" style="max-width:900px;margin:40px auto"><section class="hero"><h1>إعدادات <span>التذاكر</span></h1><p>Ayrexx • ISANO</p></section><section class="card"><h3>إعداد نظام التذاكر</h3><form method="post" action="/dashboard/tickets" class="settings"><input type="hidden" name="guildId" value="<%= selected %>"><label>Ticket Category ID<input name="ticketCategory" value="<%= settings.ticketCategory||'' %>"></label><label>Support Role ID<input name="ticketSupportRole" value="<%= settings.ticketSupportRole||'' %>"></label><label>Panel Channel ID<input name="ticketPanelChannel" value="<%= settings.ticketPanelChannel||'' %>"></label><label>Ticket Log Channel ID<input name="ticketLogChannel" value="<%= settings.ticketLogChannel||'' %>"></label><button class="btn" type="submit">حفظ الإعدادات</button><% if(saved){ %><p class="online">تم الحفظ</p><% } %></form></section><section class="card"><h3>أوامر التذاكر</h3><p>/ticket-panel — نشر اللوحة</p><p>/close — إغلاق</p><p>/ticket-reopen — إعادة فتح</p><p>/ticket-claim — استلام</p><p>/ticket-transcript — تصدير المحادثة</p><p>/ticket-add و /ticket-remove — إدارة الأعضاء</p><p>/ticket-rename — تغيير الاسم</p><p>/ticket-delete — حذف المغلقة بعد حفظ المحادثة</p></section><p>Ayrexx © 2026 — ISANO</p><a href="/dashboard?guild=<%= selected %>">العودة للوحة</a></main></body></html>